   "text": "The user is asking about p95 latency for services from last week versus the week before. I need to figure out what data sources are available and what tables contain latency data.\n\nFrom the first turn, I know:\n1. `warehouse_pg` (PostgreSQL, prod)\n2. `tinybird` (Tinybird, prod)\n\nI need to understand what tables are available in these data sources to find latency information. Let me first check the schemas of both connections, and also search for any knowledge about latency or services.",
